{
  "slug": "harness-architect",
  "name": "Harness Architect",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "harness-architect is a meta-tool that scans any target project and builds an end-to-end Claude Code harness — CLAUDE.md, settings, rules, agents, playbooks, hooks, and MCP — through a 9-phase orchestrated workflow.\n\nThe plugin enforces a strict Agent-Playbook separation (WHO / HOW): agents define identity and hand off methodology to sub-agent-only playbooks, preventing the main session from bypassing guardrails. Every phase is reviewed by an independent red-team advisor that produces BLOCK / ASK / NOTE classifications, and cross-phase state is persisted to `docs/{request}/` so interrupted sessions resume deterministically.\n\nTarget users: anyone — including non-developers — who wants a correct-from-day-one Claude Code setup on every new project without re-deriving the same 30-decision matrix each time. The plugin ships a 6-step \"strict-coding\" preset for complex coding projects and three Phase 1-2 branches (fresh setup / Cursor migration / harness audit).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 agents**, **7 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Agents** (13): `fit-auditor` (기존 Claude Code 하네스가 대상 프로젝트의 현재 특성·복잡도·도메인에 여전히 적합한지 시간축 드리프트를 감사), `harness-auditor` (기존 Claude Code 하네스의 구성 정합성·anti-pattern·권한 안전성·에이전트-플레이북 매핑을 CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW 4등급으로 진단), `ops-auditor` (기존 Claude Code 하네스의 런타임 가정·운영 부채·실패 복구 미비를 7개 Dimension으로 감사), `phase-design` (Phase 3-4 통합 에이전트), `phase-domain-research` (Phase 2.5 에이전트), `phase-hooks` (Phase 7-8 에이전트), `phase-setup-lite` (경량 트랙 Phase L 에이전트), `phase-setup` (Phase 1-2 에이전트), and 5 more\n- **Commands** (7): `audit` (Unified audit entry — runs harness-audit (configuration integrity), ops-audit (runtime debt), and fit-audit (project-fit drift) in parallel and…), `fit-audit` (Audit the fit between an already-deployed Claude Code harness and the current state of the target project (track…), `harness-audit` (Audit an existing Claude Code harness for configuration integrity (4-scope scan, JSON validity, anti-patterns, permission safety, agent↔playbook mapping)), `harness-setup` (Build a complete Claude Code harness for any project via a 9-phase orchestrated workflow (scan, workflow design, agent…), `help` (harness-architect 플러그인 사용법, 제공 커맨드, 9-Phase 흐름, 주요 옵션을 안내한다), `ops-audit` (Audit an existing Claude Code harness for runtime assumptions, operational debt, and failure recovery gaps (session continuity, retry…), `update` (설치된 harness-architect 버전을 확인하고, 새 버전이 있으면 변경사항과 함께 안내한다)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install harness-architect@claude-community` from `leee880619-commits/ClaudeCode-Harness-Setup-Assistant`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
